      "cooked": "<p>Always something and now WT has to come up with a naming scheme for it on the wiki</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/the-talented-trevor-sode\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/the-talented-trevor-sode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/the-talented-trevor-sode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: The Talented-Trevor-sode!</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Surprise! No episode this week, and yet we still put out a little something!  By now, I'm sure that's not at all surprising, since we do something like this everytime, but each one unique! This one shows off just how good Trevor is at stuff, and...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
